  "body": "> DoneBot \u4e13\u7528\u6a21\u578b\u7f51\u5173 \u2014 \u539f\u751f\u534f\u8bae\u3001\u5b89\u88c5\u51ed\u636e\u4e0e\u7edf\u4e00\u8ba1\u8d39\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udce5 Installation\n\n**Docker:**\n```bash\n# GitHub Container Registry\ndocker pull ghcr.io/zluo003/donebot-api:0.4.15\n```\n\n**One-line install (Linux):**\n```bash\ncurl -sSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Zluo003/donebot-api/main/deploy/install.sh | sudo bash\n```\n\n**Manual download:**\nDownload the appropriate archive for your platform from the assets below.\n\n## \ud83d\udcda Documentation\n\n- [GitHub Repository](https://github.com/Zluo003/donebot-api)\n- [Installation Guide](https://github.com/Zluo003/donebot-api/blob/main/deploy/README.md)\n\n"
